<title>ARGENTINA: ARGENTINA SETS $6.7 MILLION IN OVERNIGHT REPOS.</title>
<headline>ARGENTINA SETS $6.7 MILLION IN OVERNIGHT REPOS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Friday it allocated $6.7 million in overnight repurchase agreements.</p>
<p>Call money fell to 6.60 percent from 6.70 percent at the close Thursday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar fell to 0.99944 peso from 0.99981 peso Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
